    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: 'A/D or arrows move, Space jumps, Q hides. Hidden, you stop moving but
    still fall.

    Purple slime (high platform): Can Jump off. It patrols, turns
    at the edges, and waits at the edge when it sees you.

    Fire slime: Can Jump
    on. It follows you over the gap and the stone block, and jumps up toward you.'
